direction: down
title: "C23 callback producer: exact landing and delayed result custody"
"Stable VM and interpreter owner" -> "Admitted eval / event pump": "issue producer before native entry"
"Admitted eval / event pump" -> "Dynamic child InvocationId": "allowed after fresh-root close while producer remains live"
"Dynamic child InvocationId" -> "Exact landing": "session identity outside captured Scheme frames"
"Exact landing" -> "Cleanup in flight": "single authorized attempt; not marker-based idempotence"
"Cleanup in flight" -> "Settled / retained unknown": "receipt before settlement; no blind retry"
"New Tcl result" -> "Old free callback": "publish new before freeing old; track both lifetimes"
"Old free callback" -> "Result release custody": "normal known completion or retained OperationId"
"Producer sealed and results settled" -> "Prior retirement obligations": "still require collective, join, roots and descriptor grace"
"Saved Tcl result" -> "Result release custody": "owner transfer is not disposal; snapshots can outlive interpreter fields"
